UR OWN RISK: We are not responsible for any losses, damages, or issues arising from the use of this application\\n • NO GUARANTEES: We do not guarantee the accuracy of pricing data, notifications, or any other information\\n • API USAGE: This app uses publicly available APIs and may stop working if access is restricted\\n • TERMS OF SERVICE: By using this app, you agree to comply with DMarket\'s Terms of Service\\n • ACCOUNT SECURITY: Keep your API keys secure — we are not responsible for any unauthorized access to your account\\n • DATA PRIVACY: We do not collect or share your personal information beyond what is necessary for the app to function\\n\\nDMarket is a trademark of DMarket LLC. All trademarks, service marks, and company names are the property of their respective owners.\\n\\nFor issues related to your DMarket account, please contact DMarket support directly.</string>

